{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1151379-the-dark-era-pitching-game-just-for-fun","id":1151379,"title":"The Dark Era Pitching Game! [Just For Fun]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-20T10:29:06-07:00","id":1151379,"title":"The Dark Era Pitching Game! [Just For Fun]","content":"I have that concept in my head for awhile, but I've wanted that first we'll get the complete list of which Eras got to Dark Eras 2, and what expansions were decided for them. The concept if very simple- each person is allowed to give a list of the top 5 things they wish to see added/expanded to the Dark Eras, which could be as specific as a new Bloodline or antagonist or general as how a certain supernatural creature's society operates in a certain Era. Any other person who sees the list may present a wrietup of 1000 words for any of the items in the list. There are, of course, some rules for this game, as follows-<br /> <br /> - stick to either canon Eras, or ones which were suggested and didn't get chose. While original Eras are all nice and well, there are enough threads about such settings and limitation would help us all to stay focused around the subject. You may ask for something from an Era which is not out yet, however.<br /> <br /> - try to be specific in your pitch. Sure, you may ask for something general, considering the word count it is better to remain focused to get a better product when a writer would decide to get your pitch.<br /> <br /> - try to stay around the 1000 wordcount limit. Sure, no one will shoot you if you'll pass it, but it helps to keep the thread from derailing. If you feel inspired and wish to expand the pitch, feel free to do so by opening a new thread about the subject.<br /> <br /> - don't write your own pitches. That miss the point of the thread.<br /> <br /> - try to utilize the Crossover Sidebars when existing. They are there for a reason, and some have really good ideas!<br /> <br /> - don't repeat already canon gameline-Era matches, unless it is about expanding a setting material which was presented, but not covered, the the Dark Era itself (like the Blood Blessed Covenant). That includes repeating a request which was already written by someone else.<br /> <br /> - while not everyone have to write, it is a good courtesy that the most would at least try. You don't have to get to 1000 words, after all, and if everyone ask and no one writes the thread would, again, miss its goal.<br /> <br /> That's all, I think. Now, for my own requests:<br /> <br /> - Alchemists in the Sundered World<br /> - Werewolf Lodge for the Grimm Dark Era<br /> - Vampire Covenant for Jazz Age <br /> - general description of the Seers during After the Fall<br /> - a special phenomenon for Sin Eaters during the Wild West<br /> <br /> so- what about you?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-20T12:06:30-07:00","id":1151417,"title":"","content":"I'm pit